(5658799, 822717, 67152, '<td valign="top">pretty scene - the reds and oranges seem a bit oversaturated here  - i wonder if the horizon is slighly off kilter as well.<br/> <br/>it seems that this scene could really take advantage of a higher perspective where the boat in the foreground is a bit lower in the scene, the horizon higher and the sailboat would separate from the horizon a bit better....next time bring a ladder!  ;-)</td>', 'pretty scene - the reds and oranges seem a bit oversaturated here  - i wonder if the horizon is slighly off kilter as well. it seems that this scene could really take advantage of a higher perspective where the boat in the foreground is a bit lower in the scene, the horizon higher and the sailboat would separate from the horizon a bit better....next time bring a ladder!  ;-)', '2009-09-23 08:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
