(5658871, 822464, 107506, '<td valign="top">Regardless of if this fits the challenge, this shot is fing excellent. Just became my first fav</td>', 'Regardless of if this fits the challenge, this shot is fing excellent. Just became my first fav', '2009-09-23 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5658891, 822409, 54446, '<td valign="top">The DOF is deep/complete.  The glare of a flash is too evident.  If you selected a small aperture for this shot (evident by the foreground and bg in focus, the shutter speed would be somewhat slow.  Your results are good... because the flash forced the shutter speed up to 1/60s.... maybe 1/200s.  It worked, but generally, a small aperture reduces shutter speed enough to create motion blur concerns in the animal.  An interesting image to reveiw.</td>', 'The DOF is deep/complete.  The glare of a flash is too evident.  If you selected a small aperture for this shot (evident by the foreground and bg in focus, the shutter speed would be somewhat slow.  Your results are good... because the flash forced the shutter speed up to 1/60s.... maybe 1/200s.  It worked, but generally, a small aperture reduces shutter speed enough to create motion blur concerns in the animal.  An interesting image to reveiw.', '2009-09-23 09:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
