(5658922, 823086, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent deep DOF.  Super lighting... even and pleasant throughout.  Great lighting on the far structure.   Good sharpness and detail.  I hate the frame, because it reduces the viewable portion of the image.  I have no idea why you would add a frame.  This image could win the challenge, except for the big distraction of the frame.  9</td>', 'Excellent deep DOF.  Super lighting... even and pleasant throughout.  Great lighting on the far structure.   Good sharpness and detail.  I hate the frame, because it reduces the viewable portion of the image.  I have no idea why you would add a frame.  This image could win the challenge, except for the big distraction of the frame.  9', '2009-09-23 09:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
