(5658928, 823036, 54446, '<td valign="top">Moody.  Good b&amp;w.  I''ll accept the mood from underexposure as an artistic choice.  But, quite a lot of detail lost in the shadows.  Still, a very good DOF.</td>', 'Moody.  Good b&w.  I''ll accept the mood from underexposure as an artistic choice.  But, quite a lot of detail lost in the shadows.  Still, a very good DOF.', '2009-09-23 09:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
