(5659464, 822995, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field here. Feel the lighting maybe a bit off- difficult conditions to say the least and maybe another time of day would have worked better for this. Amazing place though...beautifull mountains</td>', 'Nice depth of field here. Feel the lighting maybe a bit off- difficult conditions to say the least and maybe another time of day would have worked better for this. Amazing place though...beautifull mountains', '2009-09-23 15:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659467, 823136, 86218, '<td valign="top">Alittle more depth would have made this much nicer. Maybe just personal taste but would have preferred only the 1 white sail boat at top for this to work better</td>', 'Alittle more depth would have made this much nicer. Maybe just personal taste but would have preferred only the 1 white sail boat at top for this to work better', '2009-09-23 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659468, 822814, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you entered here and this shot will most certainly get you a ribbon. Hard work pays mr prperold. Keep them coming</td>', 'Nice to see you entered here and this shot will most certainly get you a ribbon. Hard work pays mr prperold. Keep them coming', '2009-09-23 15:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659469, 822969, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed. Would love to see some richer light in sky for this but is very good as is. Really places me with this croc on his enviroment...</td>', 'Very nicely composed. Would love to see some richer light in sky for this but is very good as is. Really places me with this croc on his enviroment...', '2009-09-23 15:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659494, 822466, 109353, '<td valign="top">Over classic, DNMC ... 2</td>', 'Over classic, DNMC ... 2', '2009-09-23 15:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659516, 823096, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a hell of a view of my favorite bridge; I shot from that exact spot once myself.<br/> <br/>It does raise certain questions re: the challenge topic, inasmuch as nothing in the foreground is particularly close, so we''re arguably not really seeing "deep" DOF. On the other hand, it''s shot with a long lens, and it wasn''t easy to get the DOF as deep as you HAVE gotten it :-)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''m not an angels-on-heads-of-pins guy, so I just ignore that navel-gazing and give you a nice score. You''re certainly MUCH closer to nailing the challenge than all the shallow-DOF shots I''m seeing :-)</td>', 'That''s a hell of a view of my favorite bridge; I shot from that exact spot once myself. It does raise certain questions re: the challenge topic, inasmuch as nothing in the foreground is particularly close, so we''re arguably not really seeing "deep" DOF. On the other hand, it''s shot with a long lens, and it wasn''t easy to get the DOF as deep as you HAVE gotten it :-) Anyway, I''m not an angels-on-heads-of-pins guy, so I just ignore that navel-gazing and give you a nice score. You''re certainly MUCH closer to nailing the challenge than all the shallow-DOF shots I''m seeing :-)', '2009-09-23 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659521, 822270, 55005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image but unfortunately does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image but unfortunately does not meet the challenge.', '2009-09-23 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5659533, 823101, 99256, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Nice exposure on the water and sky.  The sunlight seems a little harsh on the woman.  Dosn''t really stand out. 5</td>', 'Cute idea.  Nice exposure on the water and sky.  The sunlight seems a little harsh on the woman.  Dosn''t really stand out. 5', '2009-09-23 16:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
