(5659602, 822096, 103142, '<td valign="top">ooh!! I love Watkin''s Glen! Live up upstate New York for 2 years right after I was married. Isn''t a wonderful place?<br/> <br/>(sorry, love the photo! I think the b&amp;w was a brave, but good choice)</td>', 'ooh!! I love Watkin''s Glen! Live up upstate New York for 2 years right after I was married. Isn''t a wonderful place? (sorry, love the photo! I think the b&w was a brave, but good choice)', '2009-09-23 16:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
