(5661833, 822096, 110370, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I would like to see this photo in color, b/c it will show proper texture of the rock walls.</td>', 'Good composition. I would like to see this photo in color, b/c it will show proper texture of the rock walls.', '2009-09-25 10:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
