(5661893, 823086, 89116, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love the textures in the sand and smoothness of the water.  The building offers an excellent focal point with some color.  However, I feel like the clouds are a bit over processed but I like the stormy look just maybe a bit less.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love the textures in the sand and smoothness of the water.  The building offers an excellent focal point with some color.  However, I feel like the clouds are a bit over processed but I like the stormy look just maybe a bit less.', '2009-09-25 10:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5661910, 822814, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, should ribbon (not voting)</td>', 'Beautiful photo, should ribbon (not voting)', '2009-09-25 11:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5661914, 822898, 102386, '<td valign="top">This is very nice! Very well done on controlling the exposure. I''ve tried shots like this, and it''s hard not blowing out the sky. So for a basic editing challenge, well done (no vote)</td>', 'This is very nice! Very well done on controlling the exposure. I''ve tried shots like this, and it''s hard not blowing out the sky. So for a basic editing challenge, well done (no vote)', '2009-09-25 11:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5661924, 822572, 102386, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot. The composition if fantastic, but I''ve seen it many times before. I''m not critisizing though, if I had the opportunity to go to Yosemite, I''d shoot this as well. I expect to see this on the front page. Ok I''m guessing here, mpeters? (no vote)</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot. The composition if fantastic, but I''ve seen it many times before. I''m not critisizing though, if I had the opportunity to go to Yosemite, I''d shoot this as well. I expect to see this on the front page. Ok I''m guessing here, mpeters? (no vote)', '2009-09-25 11:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
