(5661994, 823096, 63503, '<td valign="top">Wow, so pretty, i''ve never seen this spectacular composition before. I keep thinkig how neat would it be to duplicate it with a car headlight trail along the road. It probably can be done with just one more ND and lucky timing. It may even be worth planting the car and synchronizing via cell phone. I hate not living in San Francisco. If this picture does not ribbon then none of them should. (not voting)</td>', 'Wow, so pretty, i''ve never seen this spectacular composition before. I keep thinkig how neat would it be to duplicate it with a car headlight trail along the road. It probably can be done with just one more ND and lucky timing. It may even be worth planting the car and synchronizing via cell phone. I hate not living in San Francisco. If this picture does not ribbon then none of them should. (not voting)', '2009-09-25 12:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5661996, 822921, 110041, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but does not demonstrate ''Deep DOF'' in my opinion. Maybe high depth of field ;p</td>', 'Nice shot, but does not demonstrate ''Deep DOF'' in my opinion. Maybe high depth of field ;p', '2009-09-25 12:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
