(5662096, 822929, 110041, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot with good DOF and lovely tones and detail.<br/> <br/>My only real comment is on the composition and is that the line of bikes and paving lead my eye to the edge of picture where there is nothing of note. I don''t seem to get much ''extra'' from this shot having used a deep DOF as a shallow DOF with only the first couple of wheels in focus would still give the impression of the long line of bikes.</td>', 'Really nice shot with good DOF and lovely tones and detail. My only real comment is on the composition and is that the line of bikes and paving lead my eye to the edge of picture where there is nothing of note. I don''t seem to get much ''extra'' from this shot having used a deep DOF as a shallow DOF with only the first couple of wheels in focus would still give the impression of the long line of bikes.', '2009-09-25 13:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662113, 823130, 96311, '<td valign="top">Think this needs to be a bit brighter or a lot more contrast, like the composition but doesnt reach out n grab ya !!</td>', 'Think this needs to be a bit brighter or a lot more contrast, like the composition but doesnt reach out n grab ya !!', '2009-09-25 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
