(5662315, 822898, 90387, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors here.  Nice contrast between the oranges and blues. Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the colors here.  Nice contrast between the oranges and blues. Nice job.', '2009-09-25 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662323, 822929, 90387, '<td valign="top">Very nice black and white procesing! Based on feel alone, I think I would have liked just a tad more space left at the top.  The closest wheel feels a tiny bit cramped. Nice entry!</td>', 'Very nice black and white procesing! Based on feel alone, I think I would have liked just a tad more space left at the top.  The closest wheel feels a tiny bit cramped. Nice entry!', '2009-09-25 16:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662325, 823012, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Definitely meets the challenge in that the foreground (helmet and bike and then the background hill are pretty sharp.  A picturesque sunset to boot.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Definitely meets the challenge in that the foreground (helmet and bike and then the background hill are pretty sharp.  A picturesque sunset to boot.  Well done.', '2009-09-25 16:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662327, 823013, 90387, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I won''t be the first comment like this, but there is so little actually visible in this shot it''s hard to know if it meets the challenge. Not scoring the shot.</td>', 'I''m sure I won''t be the first comment like this, but there is so little actually visible in this shot it''s hard to know if it meets the challenge. Not scoring the shot.', '2009-09-25 16:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662335, 823096, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness in the foreground, middle ground, and the background tower beyond the clouds.  Very picturesque too.  Nice image.</td>', 'Nice sharpness in the foreground, middle ground, and the background tower beyond the clouds.  Very picturesque too.  Nice image.', '2009-09-25 16:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662340, 822801, 103032, '<td valign="top">Well done in getting good focus in the foreground rope, the middle ground boat and the background buildings.  Interesting POV, and (at least for me) interesting subject.  Nice job.</td>', 'Well done in getting good focus in the foreground rope, the middle ground boat and the background buildings.  Interesting POV, and (at least for me) interesting subject.  Nice job.', '2009-09-25 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662359, 822946, 103032, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  I''m guessing the subject matter is rigging (primary subject) for the ferris wheel (secondary subject) which doesn''t hold a lot of interest as a subject matter to me, but I feel like I owe this image a comment because It does meet the challenge in that the foreground (rigging) is sharp as well as the "middle" ground (the tent-like area), and the background (ferris wheel structure).  The chosen POV draws the viewer because it creates an interesting perspective.  Overall, you made an ordinary subject into an interesting image while keeping the challenge theme in mind.  Well done.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  I''m guessing the subject matter is rigging (primary subject) for the ferris wheel (secondary subject) which doesn''t hold a lot of interest as a subject matter to me, but I feel like I owe this image a comment because It does meet the challenge in that the foreground (rigging) is sharp as well as the "middle" ground (the tent-like area), and the background (ferris wheel structure).  The chosen POV draws the viewer because it creates an interesting perspective.  Overall, you made an ordinary subject into an interesting image while keeping the challenge theme in mind.  Well done.', '2009-09-25 16:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662367, 823116, 42013, '<td valign="top">my second favorite shot of the challenge. The lonely plant is great.</td>', 'my second favorite shot of the challenge. The lonely plant is great.', '2009-09-25 17:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662369, 822898, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good, deep, DOF. Good luck!</td>', 'Good, deep, DOF. Good luck!', '2009-09-25 17:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662372, 822572, 103032, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Good DOF showing sharpness in foreground, middle ground, and background.  Beautiful scene too.</td>', 'Well done.  Good DOF showing sharpness in foreground, middle ground, and background.  Beautiful scene too.', '2009-09-25 17:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662414, 823129, 99411, '<td valign="top">Great shot but  does not really  demonstrate the challenge topic to full effect</td>', 'Great shot but  does not really  demonstrate the challenge topic to full effect', '2009-09-25 17:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662444, 822969, 109353, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good light for the little lizard. 8</td>', 'Nice composition, good light for the little lizard. 8', '2009-09-25 18:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662445, 823077, 109353, '<td valign="top">I love it ... but not enough DOF for me. 7</td>', 'I love it ... but not enough DOF for me. 7', '2009-09-25 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662605, 821923, 88580, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the foreground rock does not stand out all that well.  I think it could use a bit more contrast and maybe a little bump in the saturation.  I really like how the trees to the left are framed.  Overall, a very nice effort, though.</td>', 'Good idea, but the foreground rock does not stand out all that well.  I think it could use a bit more contrast and maybe a little bump in the saturation.  I really like how the trees to the left are framed.  Overall, a very nice effort, though.', '2009-09-25 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662609, 822898, 88580, '<td valign="top">The leaves look great against the blue sky.  Good job of capturing the texture of the tree, too.</td>', 'The leaves look great against the blue sky.  Good job of capturing the texture of the tree, too.', '2009-09-25 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662613, 823101, 88580, '<td valign="top">lol.  Good illusion.  The title just kills me.</td>', 'lol.  Good illusion.  The title just kills me.', '2009-09-25 21:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662615, 822844, 88580, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colors...really fits with the weathered fence.  Cool framing on the trees.  Super composition.</td>', 'I like the muted colors...really fits with the weathered fence.  Cool framing on the trees.  Super composition.', '2009-09-25 21:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662621, 823013, 88580, '<td valign="top">Very dark and mysterious.  Doesn''t really scream deep DOF since there isn''t a foreground to speak of and nothing is all that sharply focused to my eye.  I do, however, inexplicably like it.</td>', 'Very dark and mysterious.  Doesn''t really scream deep DOF since there isn''t a foreground to speak of and nothing is all that sharply focused to my eye.  I do, however, inexplicably like it.', '2009-09-25 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662622, 822946, 88580, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective.  Impressive amount of detail, too.</td>', 'Awesome perspective.  Impressive amount of detail, too.', '2009-09-25 21:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662624, 823078, 88580, '<td valign="top">Now that really pops...nicely saturated colors and an amazing amount of detail in such a low-resolution image.</td>', 'Now that really pops...nicely saturated colors and an amazing amount of detail in such a low-resolution image.', '2009-09-25 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662626, 822151, 88580, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get a feeling of deep DOF; the image just doesn''t look like it goes all that deep at all.  Interesting location, pose, and composition.  I like the blue lighting--especially the rim light.</td>', 'I don''t really get a feeling of deep DOF; the image just doesn''t look like it goes all that deep at all.  Interesting location, pose, and composition.  I like the blue lighting--especially the rim light.', '2009-09-25 21:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5662627, 823077, 88580, '<td valign="top">I think I''ll recycle one of the comments that someone left on my dead fish picture a while back: "Nobody ever wants to eat the head."</td>', 'I think I''ll recycle one of the comments that someone left on my dead fish picture a while back: "Nobody ever wants to eat the head."', '2009-09-25 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1);
