(5663740, 822574, 88580, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice enough capture and an awesome location, but it really doesn''t do much for me.  I think it''s because it reminds me of a Bob Ross painting...lots of happy little trees and rocks, but with a painted-in-30-minutes feel to it.  Maybe a little HDR or a saturation boost or some more contrast?</td>', 'It''s a nice enough capture and an awesome location, but it really doesn''t do much for me.  I think it''s because it reminds me of a Bob Ross painting...lots of happy little trees and rocks, but with a painted-in-30-minutes feel to it.  Maybe a little HDR or a saturation boost or some more contrast?', '2009-09-27 00:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663742, 823074, 88580, '<td valign="top">Photographers should really learn to fight the temptation to shoot railroad tracks.  A good perspective and nice tonal range (maybe some more blacks would be good).  Works well in B/W.</td>', 'Photographers should really learn to fight the temptation to shoot railroad tracks.  A good perspective and nice tonal range (maybe some more blacks would be good).  Works well in B/W.', '2009-09-27 00:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663744, 822773, 88580, '<td valign="top">Interesting location.  Nicely framed by the foreground.</td>', 'Interesting location.  Nicely framed by the foreground.', '2009-09-27 00:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663749, 822905, 88580, '<td valign="top">Must be nice to have a location like that in which to shoot.  I like the monochromatic look.</td>', 'Must be nice to have a location like that in which to shoot.  I like the monochromatic look.', '2009-09-27 00:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663751, 822872, 88580, '<td valign="top">The star burst, in combination with the dramatic angle, really makes this shot work.</td>', 'The star burst, in combination with the dramatic angle, really makes this shot work.', '2009-09-27 00:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663752, 822744, 88580, '<td valign="top">Looks like something I would take a picture of...now whether that''s a good or bad thing, I don''t know....</td>', 'Looks like something I would take a picture of...now whether that''s a good or bad thing, I don''t know....', '2009-09-27 00:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663754, 822903, 88580, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing.  Reminds me of some 20-year-old film I just had developed.</td>', 'Interesting processing.  Reminds me of some 20-year-old film I just had developed.', '2009-09-27 00:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663757, 823036, 88580, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really seem like there''s a subject. I do like the way the trees outline a path into the fog, though.</td>', 'Doesn''t really seem like there''s a subject. I do like the way the trees outline a path into the fog, though.', '2009-09-27 00:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663760, 822276, 88580, '<td valign="top">I thought about shooting something like this.  I kinda wish I had; this looks pretty cool.  That "arm" on the right, in conjunction with the slightly off-center composition makes this shot uncomfortable/unsettling (in a good way)...something like that, anyway.</td>', 'I thought about shooting something like this.  I kinda wish I had; this looks pretty cool.  That "arm" on the right, in conjunction with the slightly off-center composition makes this shot uncomfortable/unsettling (in a good way)...something like that, anyway.', '2009-09-27 00:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663762, 822815, 88580, '<td valign="top">I like how the sky is completely blown out, but I can see the clouds nicely exposed in the reflections.</td>', 'I like how the sky is completely blown out, but I can see the clouds nicely exposed in the reflections.', '2009-09-27 00:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663763, 823092, 88580, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it looks a bit washed out to me.</td>', 'Good idea, but it looks a bit washed out to me.', '2009-09-27 00:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663764, 822935, 88580, '<td valign="top">Very punny.  lol</td>', 'Very punny.  lol', '2009-09-27 00:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663766, 823096, 88580, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point.  Cool, soft, fluffy fog.</td>', 'Great vantage point.  Cool, soft, fluffy fog.', '2009-09-27 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663768, 822929, 88580, '<td valign="top">Was that Topazed before the B/W conversion?  If so, I''d have to say I much prefer the look when it is in B/W.</td>', 'Was that Topazed before the B/W conversion?  If so, I''d have to say I much prefer the look when it is in B/W.', '2009-09-27 00:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663771, 823031, 88580, '<td valign="top">lol.  That''s just too funny.  I don''t think deep DOF is really the focus (pardon the pun) of this shot because I can''t make it past the snout.</td>', 'lol.  That''s just too funny.  I don''t think deep DOF is really the focus (pardon the pun) of this shot because I can''t make it past the snout.', '2009-09-27 00:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663776, 823116, 88580, '<td valign="top">I think I like it, although I feel like I shouldn''t because...well...it''s a parking garage.  The shopping cart was a great idea, especially given the cool shadow it''s casting.</td>', 'I think I like it, although I feel like I shouldn''t because...well...it''s a parking garage.  The shopping cart was a great idea, especially given the cool shadow it''s casting.', '2009-09-27 00:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663778, 821858, 88580, '<td valign="top">Another Bob Ross painting....</td>', 'Another Bob Ross painting....', '2009-09-27 00:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663781, 822610, 88580, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that the foreground was not in focus, but I see that is a result of the soft edges from the spray paint.  I don''t think there is anything all that interesting in this shot, but viewed as a whole, it makes one wonder why it was taken.  Provoking thought can''t be a bad thing.</td>', 'My first impression was that the foreground was not in focus, but I see that is a result of the soft edges from the spray paint.  I don''t think there is anything all that interesting in this shot, but viewed as a whole, it makes one wonder why it was taken.  Provoking thought can''t be a bad thing.', '2009-09-27 01:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663783, 822976, 88580, '<td valign="top">I like the low perspective of this shot (lower than typical for a piano picture) and the drums in the background.  I could use a bit more DOF for this challenge, but it''s good otherwise.  I think a better background would have helped, too (i.e. lose the wallpaper and mini blinds).</td>', 'I like the low perspective of this shot (lower than typical for a piano picture) and the drums in the background.  I could use a bit more DOF for this challenge, but it''s good otherwise.  I think a better background would have helped, too (i.e. lose the wallpaper and mini blinds).', '2009-09-27 01:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663784, 822895, 88580, '<td valign="top">Those blues and greens look almost unnatural and they contrast well with the oranges of the sky.</td>', 'Those blues and greens look almost unnatural and they contrast well with the oranges of the sky.', '2009-09-27 01:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5663785, 823129, 88580, '<td valign="top">Really does not meet the challenge.  Nice shot of the flowers, though.</td>', 'Really does not meet the challenge.  Nice shot of the flowers, though.', '2009-09-27 01:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
