(5664271, 822409, 5746, '<td valign="top">That was the first picture I was rating and now, when I finished is still my favorite choice. The DOF is infinitive. The colours are crisp and juicy. The ship close up is amazing. I love the perspective. Good luck - 10.</td>', 'That was the first picture I was rating and now, when I finished is still my favorite choice. The DOF is infinitive. The colours are crisp and juicy. The ship close up is amazing. I love the perspective. Good luck - 10.', '2009-09-27 17:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664273, 823027, 5746, '<td valign="top">Red accents make the picture. It''s not only the summer''s end, but it looks like the end of the world as well :)</td>', 'Red accents make the picture. It''s not only the summer''s end, but it looks like the end of the world as well :)', '2009-09-27 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664275, 822905, 5746, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour scheme. So warm and moody. It could be a good movie location. DOF is almost unlimited. Excellent composition. 10.</td>', 'Lovely colour scheme. So warm and moody. It could be a good movie location. DOF is almost unlimited. Excellent composition. 10.', '2009-09-27 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664278, 822572, 5746, '<td valign="top">Magical atmosphere. Wonderful detail and colour. DOF is deep till the end. Composition leads the eyes. Great. 10.</td>', 'Magical atmosphere. Wonderful detail and colour. DOF is deep till the end. Composition leads the eyes. Great. 10.', '2009-09-27 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664281, 822842, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very elegant colour scheme. The detail is wonderful. Love the surface of the closest rocks and tiny trees in a far distance. Fantastic shot. 10.</td>', 'Very elegant colour scheme. The detail is wonderful. Love the surface of the closest rocks and tiny trees in a far distance. Fantastic shot. 10.', '2009-09-27 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664282, 822995, 5746, '<td valign="top">It will probably please many voters. The scenery is captivating. Great deep DOF and lovely colours. 9.</td>', 'It will probably please many voters. The scenery is captivating. Great deep DOF and lovely colours. 9.', '2009-09-27 17:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664284, 822736, 5746, '<td valign="top">Quite minimalistic but nevertheless eye captivating. The composition leads an eye to the post in the middle and than up to the horizon. Great. 10.</td>', 'Quite minimalistic but nevertheless eye captivating. The composition leads an eye to the post in the middle and than up to the horizon. Great. 10.', '2009-09-27 17:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664285, 823022, 5746, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light. The green mountain looks almost unrealistic. I would''ve crop the bottom waters, but its a matter of choice. I like it a lot. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful light. The green mountain looks almost unrealistic. I would''ve crop the bottom waters, but its a matter of choice. I like it a lot. 9.', '2009-09-27 17:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664287, 823031, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great capture :) Fantastic detail. The left side of the picture doesn''t add to the image, but I guess the model''s expression was more important than that :) 9 and Good luck!</td>', 'Great capture :) Fantastic detail. The left side of the picture doesn''t add to the image, but I guess the model''s expression was more important than that :) 9 and Good luck!', '2009-09-27 17:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664288, 823096, 5746, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Just this silly cloud, which put the hill in the shadow :( Fantastic view. Good luck 9.</td>', 'Excellent! Just this silly cloud, which put the hill in the shadow :( Fantastic view. Good luck 9.', '2009-09-27 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664290, 822737, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great composition, colour and detail. I like such formations a lot. They look like modern architecture. Great choice and execution. 9.</td>', 'Great composition, colour and detail. I like such formations a lot. They look like modern architecture. Great choice and execution. 9.', '2009-09-27 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664291, 823086, 5746, '<td valign="top">Superb detail Very good composition. Prominent leading line. A bit HDR feel. Good luck - 9.</td>', 'Superb detail Very good composition. Prominent leading line. A bit HDR feel. Good luck - 9.', '2009-09-27 17:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664292, 823030, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle colour scheme. Especially the water colour and detail. Fantastic. I love the rocks. The upper part of the picture is distracting a bit. I guess you wanted to show great deep DOF by that. However, the rocks and light emerald waters are more than enough. Good luck - 8.</td>', 'I like the subtle colour scheme. Especially the water colour and detail. Fantastic. I love the rocks. The upper part of the picture is distracting a bit. I guess you wanted to show great deep DOF by that. However, the rocks and light emerald waters are more than enough. Good luck - 8.', '2009-09-27 17:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664294, 822953, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful woman and beautiful portrait. I like the contrast between fabric and stone. Great composition. I like how the staircase is framing this lady. The colour scheme is lovely. Unusual topic in a deep DOF challenge. Nice brake from landscapes :)  Good luck 9.</td>', 'Beautiful woman and beautiful portrait. I like the contrast between fabric and stone. Great composition. I like how the staircase is framing this lady. The colour scheme is lovely. Unusual topic in a deep DOF challenge. Nice brake from landscapes :)  Good luck 9.', '2009-09-27 17:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664295, 822898, 5746, '<td valign="top">The colours look almost unreal. Fantastic detail. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'The colours look almost unreal. Fantastic detail. Bumping up to 9.', '2009-09-27 17:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5664448, 822644, 72103, '<td valign="top">Great photo........but it''s not Deep DOF.  However, i''m still giving it an 8 as i love it..........   :)</td>', 'Great photo........but it''s not Deep DOF.  However, i''m still giving it an 8 as i love it..........   :)', '2009-09-27 22:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
