(5664958, 822613, 110041, '<td valign="top">Good, deep DOF with good foreground detail.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I think the harsh overexposure at the top is somewhat distracting from the distant detail of the fallen trees and the arch formed by the two sides of the gorge.<br/> <br/>For me, it''s possibly a little over-saturated which makes the picture look a little lop-sided given how dark the RHS is in contrast to the LHS. <br/> <br/>However, I do like the blues of the water as it adds a sense of eerie-ness. I''m sure if it were an advanced editing challenge, you''d have the makings of a really interesting piece of work.</td>', 'Good, deep DOF with good foreground detail. Unfortunately, I think the harsh overexposure at the top is somewhat distracting from the distant detail of the fallen trees and the arch formed by the two sides of the gorge. For me, it''s possibly a little over-saturated which makes the picture look a little lop-sided given how dark the RHS is in contrast to the LHS.  However, I do like the blues of the water as it adds a sense of eerie-ness. I''m sure if it were an advanced editing challenge, you''d have the makings of a really interesting piece of work.', '2009-09-28 11:45:53.000000', NULL, 1);
