(5666902, 823005, 106806, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thatsanicepicture:</b></div><hr/><i> Lots of drama!  Cool.  Looks a little heavy in blue, is it really that way? Great Deep DOF. <br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks.<br/> <br/>Not the blue, but the building itself in real life (let alone a photo) looks HDRred and the windows have quite a green tinge which I tried to compensate for which turned it blue. I took it more blue than it need to though - I kinda liked it that way but I did oscilate rather between versions less blue.</td>', 'Originally posted by thatsanicepicture: Lots of drama!  Cool.  Looks a little heavy in blue, is it really that way? Great Deep DOF.   Thanks. Not the blue, but the building itself in real life (let alone a photo) looks HDRred and the windows have quite a green tinge which I tried to compensate for which turned it blue. I took it more blue than it need to though - I kinda liked it that way but I did oscilate rather between versions less blue.', '2009-09-30 02:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
