(5668208, 822929, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this challenge so I missed this - would have scored very well from me!  For one thing, it has bikes.  Pictures with bikes get good scores from me.  For another, it''s a very unique and well done approach to a deep DOF - not a landscape, and a very good use of the technique.  AND it''s in b&amp;w, which works very well here to keep the focus on your shapes and structures.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I didn''t vote this challenge so I missed this - would have scored very well from me!  For one thing, it has bikes.  Pictures with bikes get good scores from me.  For another, it''s a very unique and well done approach to a deep DOF - not a landscape, and a very good use of the technique.  AND it''s in b&w, which works very well here to keep the focus on your shapes and structures.  Nicely done!', '2009-09-30 19:14:02.000000', NULL, 0),
